Name: drafting
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2026-08-17
Author: Andreas Bertsatos
Maintainer: Andreas Bertsatos <abertsatos@biol.uoa.gr>
Title: Geometry, CAD Input/Output and Technical Drawing
Description: Planar geometry primitives, ASCII DXF reading and writing,
 and a format-agnostic technical drawing model with DXF and TikZ backends.
 Provides the drafting layer for engineering design packages.
Categories: Graphics
Depends: octave (>= 11.1.0)
